      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground">
      <p>CounterSet defines a named set of counters that are available to be used by devices defined in the ResourcePool.</p>
      <p>The counters are not allocatable by themselves, but can be referenced by devices. When a device is allocated, the portion of counters it uses will no longer be available for use by other devices.</p>
      </dd>
