      <TableCell><code>object</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>Counters defines the set of counters for this CounterSet The name of each counter must be unique in that set and must be a DNS label. The maximum number of counters is 32.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>counters{"{"}{"}"}</code></TableCell>
